Before calling or visiting, write down the main concern about rabbit chewing behavior, when it started, and what has changed. Bring a current list of food, treats, supplements, preventives, and medicines with exact product names and strengths. Include recent travel, boarding, diet changes, injuries, wildlife contact, and access to household chemicals or human medication. For a possible exposure, take the package or a clear photograph when it is safe to do so.

